# Moved from scripts/hide_item.zs. These stay in the game and keep working, but JEI and the
# creative tabs leave them out. `hide` is safe in existing worlds; switching a line to redact or
# remove would also take the content out of worlds, structures and world generation.
# This file must be the same on the client and the server.

